## Prerequisites

- [mise](https://mise.jdx.dev/)
- Docker with the Compose plugin

## Local development

```bash
mise install
mise run setup
mise run dev
```

Phoenix runs at `http://localhost:4000`; Mailpit runs at
`http://localhost:8025`. Tidewave, development personas, and the mailbox are
compiled or routed only in development.

## Verification

`mise run check` runs formatting, warnings-as-errors compilation, ExUnit,
Ash migration drift, Credo, Sobelow, dependency audits, Dialyzer, frontend
type/lint/unit/accessibility/build/audit checks, Chromium Playwright smoke tests,
and a production release build. No CI workflow is generated.

## Architecture

- Phoenix controllers and Inertia form the browser boundary.
- React, strict TypeScript, Mantine, Vite, and pnpm own the client shell.
- Ash and AshPostgres own domain resources, policies, and persistence.
- Oban owns durable background work; PostgreSQL is the only required datastore.
- Swoosh owns email, with Mailpit locally and opt-in Resend in production.
- Explicit presenters allowlist every value sent to the browser.

